  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"通过此接口，用户可以获取橙子建站落地页中的特殊的表单类型，比如附带下载类型。预约表单信息包括落地页表单ID、落地页表单位置、落地页表单名字等信息。需配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。\",\"id\":\"tools.site_forms.list\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/site/forms/list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710622810127\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"tools.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710506574848\",\"reason\":\"需要先通过此接口获取授权access_token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710622810127\",\"title\":\"获取落地页预约表单信息\"}",
